hadiths[31]{hadithnumber,text}:
"815","Sadaqa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyayna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Munkadir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hazrat Jabir se riwayat kiya, unhon ne farmaya: hum me se ek aadmi ke yahan ek ladka paida hua to us ne us ka naam al-Qasim rakha, to hum ne kaha: hum tumhein Abu al-Qasim ki kunniyat nahi denge aur na koi izzat denge, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko khabar di gayi to Aap ne farmaya: apne bete ka naam Abdur Rahman rakho."
"816","Saeed bin Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ghassan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hazim ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hazrat Sahl se riwayat kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Mundhir bin Abi Usaid ko Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas laya gaya jab woh paida hue, to Aap ne unhein apni raan par rakh liya, aur Abu Usaid baithe hue the, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne samne ki kisi cheez me mashghool ho gaye, aur Abu Usaid ne apne bete ke bare me hukm diya to use Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki raan se utha liya gaya, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam hoshiyar hue to farmaya: bachcha kahan hai, to Abu Usaid ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah hum ne use wapas kar diya hai, Aap ne farmaya: us ka naam kya hai, unhon ne kaha: falan hai, Aap ne farmaya: nahi, balke us ka naam al-Mundhir hai, to us din Aap ne us ka naam al-Mundhir rakha."
"817","Abu al-Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shoaib bin Abi Hamza ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne al-Araj se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se riwayat kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek naamon me sab se zaleel tareen naam us aadmi ka hai jis ne apna naam malik al-amlaak rakha."
"818","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qasim bin al-Fazl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Saeed bin al-Muhallab se, unhon ne Talq bin Habib se riwayat kiya, unhon ne farmaya: main shafaat ke jhutlane me sab logon se barh kar tha, phir main ne Hazrat Jabir se poocha to unhon ne farmaya: Ae Tulaiq, main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: log dakhil hone ke baad aag se niklenge, aur hum wohi padhte hain jo tum padhte ho."
"819","Muhammad bin Abi Bakr al-Muqaddami ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Uthman al-Qurashi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zayyal bin Ubaid bin Hanzala ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere dada Hanzala bin Hizyem ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ye baat pasand thi ke aadmi ko us ke sab se mehboob naam aur us ki sab se mehboob kunniyat se pukara jaye."
"820","Sadaqa bin al-Fazl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Saeed al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ubaidullah se, unhon ne Nafe se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar se riwayat kiya ke Nabi ne Aasiya ka naam badal diya aur farmaya: tum Jameela ho."
"821","Ali bin Abdullah aur Saeed bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Yaqoob bin Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Muhammad bin Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Muhammad bin Amr bin Ata ne bayan kiya ke woh Hazrat Zainab bint Abi Salama ke paas gaye to unhon ne un se us ki ek behan ke naam ke bare me poocha jo us ke paas thin, unhon ne kaha: phir main ne kaha: un ka naam Barra hai, unhon ne kaha: un ka naam badal do, kyunke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Hazrat Zainab bint Jahsh se nikah kiya aur un ka naam Barra tha to Aap ne un ka naam badal kar Zainab rakh diya, aur jab Aap Hazrat Umm Salama ke paas aaye jab Aap ne un se nikah kiya aur mera naam Barra tha to Aap ne unhein mujhe Barra keh kar pukarte hue suna to farmaya: apne aap ko paak na batao, kyunke Allah hi tum me se neki wali aur badkaar aurat ko zyada janne wala hai, is ka naam Zainab rakho, to unhon ne kaha: phir woh Zainab hain, phir main ne un se kaha: naam rakho, to unhon ne kaha: use usi naam ki taraf badlo jis naam ki taraf Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne badla tha, is ka naam Zainab rakho."
"822","Ibrahim bin al-Mundhir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaid bin Hubab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Uthman bin Abdur Rahman bin Saeed al-Makhzumi ne mujh se bayan kiya, mere dada ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya, aur un ka naam al-Sarm tha, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ka naam Saeed rakha, unhon ne farmaya: main ne Hazrat Uthman raziyallahu anhu ko masjid me tek lagaye hue dekha."
"823","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Israel se, unhon ne Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne Hani bin Hani se, unhon ne Hazrat Ali raziyallahu anhu se riwayat kiya, unhon ne farmaya: jab Hazrat Hasan raziyallahu anhu paida hue to main ne un ka naam Harb rakha, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashreef laye to farmaya: mujhe mera beta dikhao, tum ne use kya naam diya hai, hum ne kaha: Harb, Aap ne farmaya: balke woh Hasan hai, phir jab Hazrat Husain raziyallahu anhu paida hue to main ne un ka naam Harb rakha, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashreef laye to farmaya: mujhe mera beta dikhao, tum ne use kya naam diya hai, hum ne kaha: Harb, Aap ne farmaya: balke woh Husain hai, phir jab teesra paida hua to main ne us ka naam Harb rakha, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashreef laye to farmaya: mujhe mera beta dikhao, tum ne use kya naam diya hai, hum ne kaha: Harb, Aap ne farmaya: balke woh Muhsin hai, phir Aap ne farmaya: main ne un ke naam Haroon ke beton ke naamon par rakhe hain, Shibr aur Shabbir aur Mushabbir."
"824","Muhammad bin Sinan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin al-Harith bin Abza ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: meri walida Raita bint Muslim ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya, unhon ne farmaya: main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath Hunain me hazir hua, to Aap ne mujh se farmaya: tumhara naam kya hai, main ne kaha: Ghurab hai, Aap ne farmaya: nahi, balke tumhara naam Muslim hai."
"825","Amr bin Marzooq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Qatada se, unhon ne Zurara bin Aufa se, unhon ne Saad bin Hisham se, unhon ne Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha se riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne ek aadmi ka zikr hua jise Shihab kaha jata tha, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: balke tum Hisham ho."
"826","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Saeed ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Zakariya se, unhon ne kaha: Aamir ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin Muti se riwayat kiya, unhon ne farmaya: main ne Muti ko kehte hue suna: main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko Fatah Makkah ke din farmate hue suna: aaj ke baad Qayamat ke din tak kisi Quraishi ko baandh kar qatal nahi kiya jayega, phir Quraish ke nafarmanon me se Muti ke siwa kisi ne Islam ko nahi paya, un ka naam al-Aas tha phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ka naam Muti rakha."
"827","Abu Al-Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuayb ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Abu Salama ne mujh se bayan kiya, ke Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha ne farmaya: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ai Aish, ye Jibril hain tum par salam bhejte hain, unhon ne kaha: Aur un par salam aur Allah ki rehmat aur us ki barkaten hon, unhon ne kaha: Aur wo wo dekhte the jo main nahi dekhti thi."
"828","Muhammad bin Uqba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ibrahim Al-Yashkuri Al-Basri ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Meri dadi Umm Kulsum bint Sumama ne mujh se bayan kiya, ke wo hajj ke liye aayi thin, to un ke bhai Mukhariq bin Sumama ne kaha: Aisha ke pas jao aur un se Usman bin Affan ke bare mein poocho, kyunke logon ne hamare han un ke bare mein bahut baten ki hain, unhon ne kaha: To main un ke pas gayi to main ne kaha: Aap ke kuch bete aap par salam bhejte hain aur aap se Usman bin Affan ke bare mein poochte hain, unhon ne kaha: Aur un par salam aur Allah ki rehmat ho, unhon ne kaha: Baharhal main is bat ki gawahi deti hun ke main ne Usman ko is ghar mein sakht garmi ki ek raat mein dekha, aur Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam par Jibril wahi la rahe the, aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne hath se Ibn Affan ki hatheli ya kandhe par marte hue farma rahe the: Likh, Usm, to Allah apne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke nazdeek us martabe par kisi shakhs ko nahi utarta tha magar jo us ke nazdeek muazzaz hota, to jo Ibn Affan ko bura kahe to us par Allah ki lanat ho."
"829","Sulaiman bin Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aswad bin Shaiban ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid bin Sumair ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Bashir bin Nahik ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bashir ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Wo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas aaye to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara naam kya hai, unhon ne kaha: Zahm, Aap ne farmaya: Balke tum Bashir ho, to jab main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath chal raha tha to Aap ne farmaya: Ai Ibn Al-Khasasiya, tum ne subah Allah par kya narazgi ki hai, tum subah Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath chal rahe ho, main ne kaha: Mere maa baap Aap par qurban, main Allah se kisi cheez par naraz nahi hun, har bhalayi main ne pa li hai, phir Aap mushrikon ki qabron par se guzre to farmaya: Ye log bahut si bhalayi se pehle reh gaye, phir Aap musalmanon ki qabron par se guzre to farmaya: Ye log bahut si bhalayi ko pa chuke, to achanak ek shakhs jo do sibti jute pehne qabron ke darmiyan chal raha tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Ai do sibti jute wale, apne sibti jute utar de, to us ne apne jute utar diye."
"830","Saeed bin Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin Iyad ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se riwayat karte hue unhon ne kaha: Main ne Laila jo Bashir ki biwi hain se bayan karte hue suna, Bashir Ibn Al-Khasasiya se riwayat karte hue, aur un ka naam Zahm tha, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ka naam Bashir rakha."
"831","Qabisa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman jo Aal Talha ke maula hain se riwayat karte hue, Kuraib se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, ke Juwairiya ka naam Barra tha, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ka naam Juwairiya rakha."
"832","Amr bin Marzuq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata bin Abi Maimuna se, Abu Rafi se, Abu Huraira se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Maimuna ka naam Barra tha, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ka naam Maimuna rakha."
"833","Umar bin Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aamash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Jabir se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat hai Aap ne farmaya: Agar main zinda raha to main apni ummat ko mana karunga, agar Allah ne chaha, ke un mein se koi apna naam Baraka aur Nafi aur Aflah rakhe, aur mujhe malum nahi unhon ne kaha: Rafi kaha ya nahi, kaha jata hai: Yahan Baraka hai, to kaha jata hai: Yahan nahi hai, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam wafat pa gaye aur Aap ne is se mana nahi farmaya."
"834","Makki ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Al-Zubair se riwayat hai unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne irada farmaya ke Yaala aur Baraka aur Nafi aur Yasar aur Aflah naam rakhne se mana farmayen aur is jaisi cheezon se, phir is ke baad Aap khamosh ho gaye to Aap ne kuch nahi farmaya."
"835","Muhammad bin Al-Musanna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Yunus bin Al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ikrima ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak Abu Zumail se riwayat karte hue unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Abbas ne mujh se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Umar bin Khattab raziyallahu anhu ne mujh se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni biwiyon se alag hue to achanak main Rabah ke pas tha jo Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ghulam hain, to main ne pukara: Ai Rabah, Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se mere liye ijazat lo."
"836","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud bin Qais ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Musa bin Yasar ne mujh se bayan kiya: Unhon ne Abu Huraira se suna, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat hai Aap ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho, kyunke main Abul Qasim hun."
"837","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Humaid Al-Tawil se, Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam bazaar mein the, to ek shakhs ne kaha: Ai Abal Qasim, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam us ki taraf mutawajjeh hue, to us ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, main ne to is shakhs ko pukara tha, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho."
"838","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Abi Al-Haitham Al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Yusuf bin Abdullah bin Salam ne mujh se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mera naam Yusuf rakha aur mujhe apni god mein bithaya aur mere sar par hath phera."
"839","Abu Al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sho'ba ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulaiman aur Mansur aur Fulan se, unhon ne Salim bin Abi Al-Ja'd se suna, woh Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum me se Ansar ke ek shakhs ke han ek ladka paida hua aur us ne us ka naam Muhammad rakhne ka irada kiya, Sho'ba ne Mansur ki hadees me kaha: Ansari ne kaha: Main use apni gardan par utha kar Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas laya, aur Sulaiman ki hadees me hai: Us ke han ek ladka paida hua to unhon ne us ka naam Muhammad rakhne ka irada kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakha karo aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakha karo, pas beshak mujhe hi Qasim banaya gaya hai, main tumhare darmiyan taqseem karta hun, aur Husayn ne kaha: Mujhe Qasim bana kar bheja gaya hai, main tumhare darmiyan taqseem karta hun."
"840","Muhammad bin Al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usama ne hum se bayan kiya, Buraid bin Abdullah bin Abi Burda se, woh Abu Burda se, woh Hazrat Abu Musa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere han ek ladka paida hua to main use Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas laya to Aap ne us ka naam Ibrahim rakha aur use khajoor se ghutti di aur us ke liye barkat ki dua ki aur use mere hawale kar diya aur woh Hazrat Abu Musa ki aulad me sab se bare the."
"841","Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, Zuhri se, woh Saeed bin Al-Musayyib se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat hai ke woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aye to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara naam kya hai, unhon ne kaha: Hazn, Aap ne farmaya: Tum Sahl ho, unhon ne kaha: Main us naam ko nahi badlunga jo mere walid ne mera rakha hai, Ibn Al-Musayyib ne kaha: Pas us ke baad se sakhti hum me barqarar rahi."
"842","Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, A'mash se, woh Salim bin Abi Al-Ja'd se, woh Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum me se ek shakhs ke han ek ladka paida hua to us ne us ka naam Qasim rakha to Ansar ne kaha: Hum tumhe Abu Al-Qasim ki kunniyat nahi denge aur na tumhe khush karenge, pas woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aya aur Aap se woh baat kahi jo Ansar ne kahi thi to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ansar ne khoob kaha, mere naam par naam rakha karo aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakha karo, pas beshak main hi Qasim hun."
"843","Abu Nu'aim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fitr ne hum se bayan kiya, Munzir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Al-Hanafiyya ko kehte hue suna: Ali ke liye ijazat thi, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, agar Aap ke baad mere han bachcha paida ho to kya main us ka naam Aap ke naam par rakhun aur us ki kunniyat Aap ki kunniyat par rakhun, Aap ne farmaya: Haan."
"844","Abdullah bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Laith ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne mujh se bayan kiya, woh apne walid se, woh Hazrat Abu Huraira se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apne naam aur apni kunniyat ko jama karne se mana farmaya aur farmaya: Main Abu Al-Qasim hun aur Allah deta hai aur main taqseem karta hun."
"845","Abu Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sho'ba ne hum se bayan kiya, Humaid se, woh Hazrat Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam bazaar me the to ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Aba Al-Qasim, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam mutawajjeh hue to us ne kaha: Main ne ise pukara hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho."
